0,Sanhaja de Srair language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanhaja_de_Srair_language,"Afro-Asiatic. Berber.Senhaja Berber or Tasenhajit (Senhaja De Srair: Taṣenhajit, Arabic: الصنهاجية, romanized: aṣ-ṣanhājiyah), is a Northern Berber language.",Senhaja Berber,Afro-Asiatic
