3,Senhaja Srair » Introduction,https://www.webonary.org/senhaja/overview/introduction/?lang=en,"Senhaja Berber is spoken by the Senhaja de Sraïr tribe confederation in the western part of the Rif mountains, northern Morocco. This tribe confederation consists of ten tribes (following the traditional terminology), which correspond to ten varieties of Senhaja.",Senhaja Berber,Afro-Asiatic
